---
title: "Finish or reject a storage transaction"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Transaction active | unfinished | none
  s1: Engine closed | unfinished | none
  s2: Private row staged | unfinished | none
  s3: Commit accepted | finished | success
  s4: Commit after engine close | unfinished | closed error
  s5: Commit rejected | unfinished | validation error
  s6: Second commit result | finished | finished error
  s7: Begin after engine close | unfinished | closed error
  s8: Engine closed | unfinished | validation error
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Close the engine
  s0 --> s2: Stage a row
  s1 --> s4: Try commit after close
  s2 --> s3: Commit succeeds
  s2 --> s5: Schema validation fails
  s2 --> s1: Close the engine
  s3 --> s6: Commit again
  s4 --> s7: Try begin after close
  s5 --> s8: Close the engine
  s8 --> s4: Try commit after close
